# "diwethaf" (last, previous), with the alternative forms the
# entry lists; the entry gives "wythnos diwethaf" (last week) as a derived
# term.  Source: en.wiktionary.org, https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/diwethaf.
diwethaf
diwetha
diweddaf
# "ddiwethaf" is the soft mutation of the same headword, which is what a
# feminine singular noun takes: CLDR gives the masculine "mis diwethaf"
# against the feminine "wythnos ddiwethaf" (dateFields, locale "cy",
# month/week relative-type--1).  The mutation cell is the radical -> soft
# column of the entry's own mutation table.
ddiwethaf
